The npx artifact's THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/components.json is generated from Bun's
exact module graph. It records every npm package and vendored component that
contributed bundled bytes, the selected permissive license, all discovered
license/notice artifacts, versions, and the patched Ink digest. The build fails
closed on a missing/unsupported license, missing reviewed runtime, duplicate
component, or artifact-name collision.
